{"instruction": "Given the sentence \"Members of two soccer teams struggle on the field to get the ball.\" is it true that \"The two teams are playing on the field.\"?\n认真思考，然后做出解答：", "output": "The teams struggle to get the ball which means the teams are playing on the field.\n所以，答案是：\nyes"}
