{"instruction": "路透洛杉矶7月3日电(记者Jennifer Martinez)---如果将“美国偶像”和现代童话完美结合，你将收获《布吉摇摆：超级巨星》（\"Boogie SuperStar\"）--最新跳舞游戏，由电子艺界为任天堂公司的Wii系列专门设计。\n翻译成英文：", "output": "LOS ANGELES (Reuters) - If \"American Idol\" and a modern fairy tale combined to create a video game, you'd get \"Boogie SuperStar\" -- Electronic Art's latest game for the Nintendo Wii system."}
