{"instruction": "Is the following a factual statement?\n\"General Motors constructs bodies of ships and submarines.\"\nOptions:\n- yes\n- no\n请仔细认真地思考，然后给出你的答案：", "output": "This statement is false because General Motors do not deal with body building of ships and submarines.\n所以，答案是：\nno"}
