{"instruction": "写一首短诗，用北风起誓，表达一种决绝、冰冷、永不回头的心境，意象要简练有力", "output": "以終年不息的北風為誓，\n在明日的春天來領之前，\n我的心啊，請變為冰冷的硬石\n去吧，去吧，\n去到那無人無跡的地方，\n在那裡生根，永不回頭。"}
{"instruction": "帮我回一句，就说有人连廉价的感情都珍视，但本质还是重吐槽搞笑的", "output": "当然，也有人连这种廉价的感情都很珍视，但归根结底这也是一个重吐槽和搞笑的"}
{"instruction": "最近老梦见以前的朋友，你说他们会不会也偶尔想起我？算了，还是别想了", "output": "梦见了过去的朋友，我在想对方会不会也偶尔想起来我呢？还是算了吧"}
{"instruction": "对于下面的问题，请给出你的推理过程：\n\"The Cowboy Rides Away\" is a song written by Sonny Throckmorton and Casey Kelly, and recorded by American country music artist George Strait. It was released in January 1985 as the second single from his album Does Fort Worth Ever Cross Your Mind. It peaked at number 5 on the United States Billboard Hot Country Singles chart, and at number 3 on the RPM Country Tracks chart in Canada. It is the song used by Strait to close out his performances. This is also the name of his last and final tour commencing January 18, 2013.\n\nBased on this passage, who wrote the song the cowboy rides away?", "output": "The relevant sentence in the passage is: \"The Cowboy Rides Away\" is a song written by Sonny Throckmorton and Casey Kelly, and recorded by American country music artist George Strait.\n最终的答案是：\nSonny Throckmorton and Casey Kelly"}
