{"instruction": "请进行一步一步的推理，然后给出答案：\nGiven the sentence \"A man watches a boy on his skateboard outside a pizza stand.\" can we conclude that \"The boy rides his bicycle while a woman watches.\"?\nOptions:\n- yes\n- it is not possible to tell\n- no", "output": "A boy cannot skateboard and ride his bicycle at the same time.\n最终的答案是：\nno"}
