{"instruction": "问题：Of the below sentences, which one does *not* make sense?\nOptions:\n- Sentence A: \"money can be used for buying cars\"\n- Sentence B: \"money can be used for buying stars\"\n\n让我们认真地思考这个问题：", "output": "Money can not buy ownership to celestial matter.\n所以，答案是：\nSentence B"}
